{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智旭述"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皆記自六群比丘等故制"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在第三分滅諍犍度中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此戒相頌，藕益老人述于毗尼\n集要，今從彼添入。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別眾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以下一一戒，皆用此十義故結，\n不復重出。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "最初未制戒等以下諸戒皆同，不重出。"}
